{"title": "France Imposes Curfews Amidst Weekend Riots", "summary": "Following days of rioting, France has introduced localized curfews in areas where required. Authorities are implementing these measures to restore calm after widespread unrest. The curfews are part of a broader crackdown on rioters.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "फ्रांस में सप्ताहांत दंगों के बीच कर्फ्यू लागू", "summary_hi": "कई दिनों के दंगों के बाद, फ्रांस ने आवश्यक स्थानों पर स्थानीय कर्फ्यू लागू कर दिया है। अधिकारियों द्वारा व्यापक अशांति के बाद शांति बहाल करने के लिए ये उपाय लागू किए जा रहे हैं। कर्फ्यू व्यापक दंगाइयों पर कार्रवाई का हिस्सा हैं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Emphasized the imposition of curfews as a measure to bring calm.", "Highlighted the government's crackdown on rioters."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["शांति लाने के उपाय के रूप में कर्फ्यू लगाने पर जोर दिया।", "दंगाइयों पर सरकार की कार्रवाई को उजागर किया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": "2026-10-20T16:35:23", "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Deutsche Welle", "owner": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQc05YYl9mV3l4a0ZxM19ESF9kWDJ4ZkFVMXFNMzQ2RnFGa3BfOFY1X0tQYUZwVUFJUUpMTDRPSk9vUzBOUTZOUXd4ckc0Si01N2ZkOHZhRXRieklRRURLUlA1bldBbFJ0RndtSkQwNjYxaDduSGNjTkRYcjZmUmU0Z2FyX3FUcUs5RlRrSkl2cVk5bzNHYnRQREFR?oc=5", "headline": "After days of rioting, France introduces localized curfews", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "Deccan Chronicle", "owner": "Deccan Chronicle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Curfews Bring Calm as France Cracks Down on Weekend Rioters", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "Le Monde", "owner": "Le Monde", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNbVJIaTZiam9Yd3g2eGRad2Zpb0NhVkpGaE54bFg4N045cGFBa3JwdVJDbXduMVA3QmV3SXdlMVpucTY2dXFuWWMyYWsxMTEy